flowchart TD
    U[User question] --> UI[Rich terminal UI]
    UI --> G[LangGraph workflow]
    G --> L[LLM node]
    L --> D{Needs a tool?}
    D -->|No| A[Markdown final answer]
    D -->|Yes| T[Tool node]
    T --> C{Cached result?}
    C -->|Yes| M[Session memory]
    C -->|No| W[Web search / page scraper]
    W --> R[Tool result]
    R --> S[Source URL collection]
    S --> M
    M --> L
    A --> SRC[Markdown Sources section]
    